{"organizations": [], "uuid": "9a797cb0f065be4e756565a26e32c8a73425c602", "thread": {"social": {"gplus": {"shares": 0}, "pinterest": {"shares": 0}, "vk": {"shares": 0}, "linkedin": {"shares": 0}, "facebook": {"likes": 0, "shares": 0, "comments": 0}, "stumbledupon": {"shares": 0}}, "site_full": "www.edigest.hk", "main_image": "https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/iphone_4269939075bff54eadb4fb.png", "site_section": "http://www.edigest.hk/feed", "section_title": "經濟一週", "url": "https://www.edigest.hk/78075/investment/%e4%b8%ad%e7%be%8e%e8%b2%bf%e6%98%93%e6%88%b0-g20-20%e5%9c%8b%e9%9b%86%e5%9c%98%e9%ab%98%e5%b3%b0%e6%9c%83-%e7%89%b9%e6%9c%97%e6%99%ae-donald-trump-%e4%b8%ad%e5%9c%8b-iphone-%e8%98%8b%e6%9e%9c/", "country": "HK", "title": "特朗普欲對國產iPhone徵稅 蘋果股價月內插兩成｜中美貿易戰", "performance_score": 0, "site": "edigest.hk", "participants_count": 1, "title_full": "", "spam_score": 0.0, "site_type": "news", "published": "2018-11-29T05:03:00.000+02:00", "replies_count": 0, "uuid": "9a797cb0f065be4e756565a26e32c8a73425c602"}, "author": "投資", "url": "https://www.edigest.hk/78075/investment/%e4%b8%ad%e7%be%8e%e8%b2%bf%e6%98%93%e6%88%b0-g20-20%e5%9c%8b%e9%9b%86%e5%9c%98%e9%ab%98%e5%b3%b0%e6%9c%83-%e7%89%b9%e6%9c%97%e6%99%ae-donald-trump-%e4%b8%ad%e5%9c%8b-iphone-%e8%98%8b%e6%9e%9c/", "ord_in_thread": 0, "title": "特朗普欲對國產iPhone徵稅 蘋果股價月內插兩成｜中美貿易戰", "locations": [], "entities": {"persons": [], "locations": [], "organizations": []}, "highlightText": "", "language": "chineset", "persons": [], "text": "on November 29, 2018 at 11:03 am 【 投資 】中美貿易戰持續上演，20國集團（G20 ）高峰會在即，全球對中美雙方談話十分關注。美國總統特朗普（Donald Trump）26日表示，美國計劃對進口中國製造的 iPhone 與筆記本電腦徵收 10% 關稅，令蘋果股價在週二下挫。\n撰文：Smart ED編輯部｜圖片：中新社、 unsplash ｜資源來源： CNBC 閱讀全文\n</p> <div class=\"_page_ _page_2 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div> <h2><strong>電子產品都加徵關稅？</strong></h2> <p>美國總統特朗普（Donald Trump）於26日在接受《華爾街日報（The Wall Street Journal）》採訪時表示，可能推進擴大對中國商品加徵關稅的計畫。</p> <p>除了由明年1月1日起，將對 2670 億美元的中國貨品提高25%關稅外，若未能與中國達成協議，關稅範疇將繼續擴大到消費性電子產品。</p> <figure id=\"attachment_78091\" style=\"width: 1000px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-78091\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0001_6139074685bff5508a78a0.jpg\" alt=\"中美貿易戰, G20, 20國集團高峰會, 美國總統, 特朗普, Donald Trump, 進口, 中國, 製造, iPhone, 筆記本電腦, 關稅, 蘋果, 股價\" width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0001_6139074685bff5508a78a0.jpg 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0001_6139074685bff5508a78a0-800x480.jpg 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0001_6139074685bff5508a78a0-768x461.jpg 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0001_6139074685bff5508a78a0-165x99.jpg 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0001_6139074685bff5508a78a0-392x235.jpg 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0001_6139074685bff5508a78a0-360x215.jpg 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：中新社</figcaption></figure> <h2>中國生產的iPhone是目標</h2> <p>他又指，不排除會對在中國生產的iPhone和筆記本電腦徵收10%關稅，希望解決不公平貿易。</p> <p>手機和電腦一向是中國對美國最大宗的出口項目之一，特朗普政府一直都很擔心美國消費者對此類貨品徵稅的反應。</p> <p>但他認為，10%的關稅是消費者可以接受的範圍，如果想避免關稅，建議這些公司應該把生產線搬回美國。</p> <figure id=\"attachment_78095\" style=\"width: 1000px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-78095\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/nnnn00006_282748785bff5517a941a.jpg\" alt=\"中美貿易戰, G20, 20國集團高峰會, 美國總統, 特朗普, Donald Trump, 進口, 中國, 製造, iPhone, 筆記本電腦, 關稅, 蘋果, 股價\" width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/nnnn00006_282748785bff5517a941a.jpg 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/nnnn00006_282748785bff5517a941a-800x480.jpg 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/nnnn00006_282748785bff5517a941a-768x461.jpg 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/nnnn00006_282748785bff5517a941a-165x99.jpg 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/nnnn00006_282748785bff5517a941a-392x235.jpg 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/nnnn00006_282748785bff5517a941a-360x215.jpg 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：unsplash</figcaption></figure> <h2><strong>貿易糾紛未能解決？</strong></h2> <p>特朗普將於本月30日，在G20高峰會上，與中國國家主席習近平會晤，調解兩國貿易糾紛。</p> <p>有中方官員表示，是次會面重點在於說服美國暫停調高關稅至25%的計劃。</p> <p>但特朗普強調，「非常不可能」接受中國所提出推遲擴大徵稅計劃的要求，並表示「唯一的協議就是中國必須對來自美國的競爭打開大門」。</p> <figure id=\"attachment_78094\" style=\"width: 1000px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-78094\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0004_18166852375bff550de45d4.jpg\" alt=\"中美貿易戰, G20, 20國集團高峰會, 美國總統, 特朗普, Donald Trump, 進口, 中國, 製造, iPhone, 筆記本電腦, 關稅, 蘋果, 股價\" width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0004_18166852375bff550de45d4.jpg 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0004_18166852375bff550de45d4-800x480.jpg 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0004_18166852375bff550de45d4-768x461.jpg 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0004_18166852375bff550de45d4-165x99.jpg 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0004_18166852375bff550de45d4-392x235.jpg 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0004_18166852375bff550de45d4-360x215.jpg 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：中新社</figcaption></figure> <h2><strong>蘋果股價插水</strong></h2> <p>消息傳出後，蘋果股價立即在週二開始下挫，本月已大跌 20%。</p> <p>蘋果公司的產品本可豁免關稅，但一旦特朗普對額外 2670 億美元的中國商品加徵關稅，情況將會改變。</p> <p>市場分析機構Bernstein的分析師Toni Sacconaghi在CNBC稱：「蘋果有 25% 的營收，約 500 億美元，將被課徵關稅 10% 或 25%。」</p> <figure id=\"attachment_78096\" style=\"width: 1000px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-78096\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/nnnn00004_6236548845bff5536c3090.jpg\" alt=\"中美貿易戰, G20, 20國集團高峰會, 美國總統, 特朗普, Donald Trump, 進口, 中國, 製造, iPhone, 筆記本電腦, 關稅, 蘋果, 股價\" width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/nnnn00004_6236548845bff5536c3090.jpg 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/nnnn00004_6236548845bff5536c3090-800x480.jpg 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/nnnn00004_6236548845bff5536c3090-768x461.jpg 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/nnnn00004_6236548845bff5536c3090-165x99.jpg 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/nnnn00004_6236548845bff5536c3090-392x235.jpg 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/nnnn00004_6236548845bff5536c3090-360x215.jpg 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：unsplash</figcaption></figure> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_6 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div> <h2><strong>中國會如何應對？</strong></h2> <p>他分析，特朗普持續對中國商品加徵關稅的最大問題，在於「中國會如何應對？（“How is China going to respond?”）」。</p> <p>他說：「中國會否試圖擾亂蘋果的供應鏈？ 又或者不批准在該國銷售蘋果的新手機？ 中國可以做很多事情回應，最終更可能具破壞性。」</p> <figure id=\"attachment_78093\" style=\"width: 1000px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-78093\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0003_7864404965bff550c5ccfe.jpg\" alt=\"中美貿易戰, G20, 20國集團高峰會, 美國總統, 特朗普, Donald Trump, 進口, 中國, 製造, iPhone, 筆記本電腦, 關稅, 蘋果, 股價\" width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0003_7864404965bff550c5ccfe.jpg 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0003_7864404965bff550c5ccfe-800x480.jpg 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0003_7864404965bff550c5ccfe-768x461.jpg 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0003_7864404965bff550c5ccfe-165x99.jpg 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0003_7864404965bff550c5ccfe-392x235.jpg 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0003_7864404965bff550c5ccfe-360x215.jpg 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：中新社</figcaption></figure> <h2>蘋果目標價遭下調</h2> <p>蘋果曾敦促美國政府不要施行影響蘋果產品的關稅，希望尋找其他更有效的解決方案。</p> <p>蘋果表示，實施關稅將導致美國經濟增長和競爭力下降，加重消費者的經濟負擔。</p> <p>特朗普此番言論一出，直接導致了蘋果股價下跌。</p> <p>加拿大皇家銀行資本市場（RBC Capital Markets）在星期二（27日）將蘋果股票的目標價下調至235美元，並表示「有持續數據顯示，來自於供應鏈及其他地方的 iPhone 需求表現疲軟」。</p> <figure id=\"attachment_78092\" style=\"width: 1000px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-78092\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0002_16694278975bff550ac964d.jpg\" alt=\"中美貿易戰, G20, 20國集團高峰會, 美國總統, 特朗普, Donald Trump, 進口, 中國, 製造, iPhone, 筆記本電腦, 關稅, 蘋果, 股價\" width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0002_16694278975bff550ac964d.jpg 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0002_16694278975bff550ac964d-800x480.jpg 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0002_16694278975bff550ac964d-768x461.jpg 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0002_16694278975bff550ac964d-165x99.jpg 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0002_16694278975bff550ac964d-392x235.jpg 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/0002_16694278975bff550ac964d-360x215.jpg 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：中新社</figcaption></figure> <h2><strong>延伸閱讀：2019年炒股獲利難？ 沈大師﹕恒指仍可能下試20,000點</strong></h2> <p>【<a href=\"https://www.edigest.hk/s/%E6%8A%95%E8%B3%87/?from=wordpress_search&w=%E6%8A%95%E8%B3%87\">投資</a>】2018年港股走勢較去年波動，而中美貿易戰、新興市場走資潮、內地債市爆煲等負面因素繼續纏繞至2019年。投資者也要慎防大戶以任何借口舞高大市出貨。因此，2019年投資港股獲利難度大增。</p> <p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">撰文：Smart ED編輯部 ｜圖片：新傳媒資料室</span></p> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_9 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div> <p>對於港股未來一年走勢，市場必定聚焦美國加息步伐、貿易戰會否戛然而止。</p> <p>先講貿易戰，現時市場瞄準11月底的習特會。</p> <p>訊匯沈振盈指出，即使貿易戰談判成功，未來三個月恒指仍有可能下試20,000點。</p> <p>除上文提到貿易談判這個因素外，美國加息步伐與英國「脫歐」進程均影響來年恒指走勢。</p> <figure id=\"attachment_77461\" style=\"width: 1000px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-77461 size-full\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-12a_8388433565bfb798663a8d.jpg\" alt=\"中美貿易戰, G20, 20國集團高峰會, 美國總統, 特朗普, Donald Trump, 進口, 中國, 製造, iPhone, 筆記本電腦, 關稅, 蘋果, 股價\" width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-12a_8388433565bfb798663a8d.jpg 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-12a_8388433565bfb798663a8d-800x480.jpg 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-12a_8388433565bfb798663a8d-768x461.jpg 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-12a_8388433565bfb798663a8d-165x99.jpg 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-12a_8388433565bfb798663a8d-392x235.jpg 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-12a_8388433565bfb798663a8d-360x215.jpg 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：中新社</figcaption></figure> <h2> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_10 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div><strong>企業盈利有隱憂</strong></h2> <p>英國將於2019年3月29日脫離歐洲聯盟。</p> <p>近日英國公布「脫歐」協議文本，與歐盟就「脫歐」後繼續保持密切關係達成原則性聲明。</p> <p>惟英國首相文翠珊遭到執政保守黨議員及工黨議員圍攻。</p> <p>而西班牙亦因直布羅陀問題威脅否決，英國「脫歐」隨時變成亂局。</p> <p>沈振盈補充，企業盈利也有隱憂，將左右2019年恒指表現。</p> <figure id=\"attachment_77463\" style=\"width: 1000px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-77463 size-full\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-13_17295443215bfb798d49009.jpg\" alt=\"中美貿易戰, G20, 20國集團高峰會, 美國總統, 特朗普, Donald Trump, 進口, 中國, 製造, iPhone, 筆記本電腦, 關稅, 蘋果, 股價\" width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-13_17295443215bfb798d49009.jpg 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-13_17295443215bfb798d49009-800x480.jpg 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-13_17295443215bfb798d49009-768x461.jpg 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-13_17295443215bfb798d49009-165x99.jpg 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-13_17295443215bfb798d49009-392x235.jpg 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-13_17295443215bfb798d49009-360x215.jpg 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：新傳媒資料室</figcaption></figure> <p>現時市傳蘋果公司（Apple，美股編號：AAPL）將會削減訂單，像瑞聲科技（02018）、舜宇光學科技等手機零件「股王」來年純利增長難以看好。</p> <p>環球政經因素對港股不利，惟投資者要慎防大戶以任何借口先推高大市後沽貨。</p> <p>單純以中美貿易談判而言，傲揚尹滿華指出：「即使談判沒有共識，也被視為長期談判而作鋪路，對2019年大市走向有利。」</p> <figure id=\"attachment_77470\" style=\"width: 1000px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-77470 size-full\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-18a_8963947895bfb7dcd38a29.jpg\" alt=\"中美貿易戰, G20, 20國集團高峰會, 美國總統, 特朗普, Donald Trump, 進口, 中國, 製造, iPhone, 筆記本電腦, 關稅, 蘋果, 股價\" width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-18a_8963947895bfb7dcd38a29.jpg 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-18a_8963947895bfb7dcd38a29-800x480.jpg 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-18a_8963947895bfb7dcd38a29-768x461.jpg 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-18a_8963947895bfb7dcd38a29-165x99.jpg 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-18a_8963947895bfb7dcd38a29-392x235.jpg 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-18a_8963947895bfb7dcd38a29-360x215.jpg 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：新傳媒資料室</figcaption></figure> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_12 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div> <p>從這個角度出發，當中美貿易談判稍為有好消息，不排除大戶借機出貨，以減低在調整市中的損失。</p> <p>另一個借勢炒高出貨的借口為A股投資形勢稍為好轉，立即拉動港股短線反彈。</p> <p>尹滿華指出，現時影響內地股市有三大原因，分別是去槓桿、中美貿易摩擦及企業投資信心。</p> <p>內地經濟一直由國策主導，尹滿華會更留意內地政府的救市方針，未來內地將會有更多救市招數推出市場，以穩定人心。</p> <figure id=\"attachment_77467\" style=\"width: 1213px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-77467 size-full\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa12box_9507904325bfb7ad923b91.png\" alt=\"中美貿易戰, G20, 20國集團高峰會, 美國總統, 特朗普, Donald Trump, 進口, 中國, 製造, iPhone, 筆記本電腦, 關稅, 蘋果, 股價\" width=\"1213\" height=\"842\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa12box_9507904325bfb7ad923b91.png 1213w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa12box_9507904325bfb7ad923b91-800x555.png 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa12box_9507904325bfb7ad923b91-768x533.png 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa12box_9507904325bfb7ad923b91-1024x711.png 1024w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa12box_9507904325bfb7ad923b91-392x272.png 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa12box_9507904325bfb7ad923b91-1050x729.png 1050w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1213px) 100vw, 1213px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：新傳媒資料室</figcaption></figure> <h2> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_13 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div><strong> A股具吸引力</strong></h2> <p>例如現時內地政府推出不同政策讓內地經濟可以「軟着陸」，如在減稅、減息，或者下調存款準備金率方面做了很多功夫，加上內地政府在政策上面的推動和力度可能超乎我們想像。</p> <p>尹滿華認為內地政府仍有很多工具可以做到，因港股與A股關係密切，如果這些工具可以好好運用，不論對港股還是A股都有很好的發展。尹滿華相信港股有機會收復32,000點關口。</p> <p>然而，2019年人民幣匯率走向有機會利淡港股，以致A股走勢。</p> <figure id=\"attachment_77462\" style=\"width: 1000px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-77462 size-full\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-12b_3101911995bfb798be085c.jpg\" alt=\"中美貿易戰, G20, 20國集團高峰會, 美國總統, 特朗普, Donald Trump, 進口, 中國, 製造, iPhone, 筆記本電腦, 關稅, 蘋果, 股價\" width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-12b_3101911995bfb798be085c.jpg 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-12b_3101911995bfb798be085c-800x480.jpg 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-12b_3101911995bfb798be085c-768x461.jpg 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-12b_3101911995bfb798be085c-165x99.jpg 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-12b_3101911995bfb798be085c-392x235.jpg 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-12b_3101911995bfb798be085c-360x215.jpg 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：新傳媒資料室</figcaption></figure> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_14 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div>尹滿華對人民幣匯價有信心，因為2019年人民幣匯價不是這麼容易失守七算水平。</p> <p>現時市場對中國的經濟信心會較弱，就是害怕人民幣會一直貶值下去。不過，長遠而言，人民幣幣值將有機會穩定下來。</p> <p>安本標準姚鴻耀認為，A股受外圍因素影響會繼續波動，短期內仍有下跌風險，難以估計現時是否已見底。</p> <figure id=\"attachment_77472\" style=\"width: 1000px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-77472 size-full\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/china0002_7454540125bfb7e62bc564.png\" alt=\"中美貿易戰, G20, 20國集團高峰會, 美國總統, 特朗普, Donald Trump, 進口, 中國, 製造, iPhone, 筆記本電腦, 關稅, 蘋果, 股價\" width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/china0002_7454540125bfb7e62bc564.png 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/china0002_7454540125bfb7e62bc564-800x480.png 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/china0002_7454540125bfb7e62bc564-768x461.png 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/china0002_7454540125bfb7e62bc564-165x99.png 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/china0002_7454540125bfb7e62bc564-392x235.png 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/china0002_7454540125bfb7e62bc564-360x215.png 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：新傳媒資料室</figcaption></figure> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_15 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div>不過未來他對中國市場前景依然抱有信心，認為A股的估值及基本因素仍具吸引力。</p> <p>姚鴻耀補充，現時A股的企業盈利增長約10至15%，但市盈率只有9至10倍，估值較其他市場低。</p> <p>根據尹滿華及姚鴻耀的分析，港股及A股均不乏利好因素。</p> <p>不過， 2019年環球政經形勢一般， 投資者就要小心任何利好因素短癮，不但難以支持恒指重拾升軌，更淪為大戶出貨的借口，投資者不可不察箇中風險。</p> <figure id=\"attachment_77471\" style=\"width: 1000px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-77471 size-full\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/china0001_19596110155bfb7e5e8f563.png\" alt=\"中美貿易戰, G20, 20國集團高峰會, 美國總統, 特朗普, Donald Trump, 進口, 中國, 製造, iPhone, 筆記本電腦, 關稅, 蘋果, 股價\" width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/china0001_19596110155bfb7e5e8f563.png 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/china0001_19596110155bfb7e5e8f563-800x480.png 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/china0001_19596110155bfb7e5e8f563-768x461.png 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/china0001_19596110155bfb7e5e8f563-165x99.png 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/china0001_19596110155bfb7e5e8f563-392x235.png 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/china0001_19596110155bfb7e5e8f563-360x215.png 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：新傳媒資料室</figcaption></figure> <h2> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_16 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div><strong>明年新股上市勝今年</strong></h2> <p>2019年香港的首次公開招股（IPO）數目勢將超過今年。</p> <p>早前有報道指出2019年有意赴港上市的公司超過250間，當中不少都是科技領域和生物科技企業。</p> <p>今年4月引入的「同股不同權」架構，即使未有盈利的生物科技企業仍可在香港上市，吸引生物科技企業赴港上市，新規定實行至今來港上市的公司數目，總融資額已超越美國同類股票。</p> <figure id=\"attachment_77464\" style=\"width: 1000px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-77464 size-full\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-19_19998679515bfb7995ee67d.jpg\" alt=\"中美貿易戰, G20, 20國集團高峰會, 美國總統, 特朗普, Donald Trump, 進口, 中國, 製造, iPhone, 筆記本電腦, 關稅, 蘋果, 股價\" width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-19_19998679515bfb7995ee67d.jpg 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-19_19998679515bfb7995ee67d-800x480.jpg 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-19_19998679515bfb7995ee67d-768x461.jpg 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-19_19998679515bfb7995ee67d-165x99.jpg 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-19_19998679515bfb7995ee67d-392x235.jpg 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa-photo-19_19998679515bfb7995ee67d-360x215.jpg 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：新傳媒資料室</figcaption></figure> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_17 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div> <p>單計今年至今來港上市公司所集資的規模達326億美元，同比急升187%， 料今年全年將有220家企業在港上市，料可重奪全球新股市場集資額第一位。</p> <p>市場人士普遍相信即使市況低迷，仍有很多公司希望以「同股不同權」形式來港掛牌上市，故總集資額將會超越2018年。</p> <p>中國平安（02318）旗下內地互聯網金融平台陸金所最快於2019年上半年來港上市。</p> <figure id=\"attachment_77465\" style=\"width: 1508px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-77465 size-full\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa19box_13373569085bfb79a08d829.png\" alt=\"中美貿易戰, G20, 20國集團高峰會, 美國總統, 特朗普, Donald Trump, 進口, 中國, 製造, iPhone, 筆記本電腦, 關稅, 蘋果, 股價\" width=\"1508\" height=\"494\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa19box_13373569085bfb79a08d829.png 1508w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa19box_13373569085bfb79a08d829-800x262.png 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa19box_13373569085bfb79a08d829-768x252.png 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa19box_13373569085bfb79a08d829-1024x335.png 1024w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa19box_13373569085bfb79a08d829-392x128.png 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934acsa19box_13373569085bfb79a08d829-1050x344.png 1050w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1508px) 100vw, 1508px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：新傳媒資料室</figcaption></figure> <p>免責聲明：本專頁刊載的所有投資分析技巧，只可作參考用途。市場瞬息萬變，讀者在作出投資決定前理應審慎，並主動掌握市場最新狀況。若不幸招致任何損失，概與本刊及相關作者無關。而本集團旗下網站或社交平台的網誌內容及觀點，僅屬筆者個人意見，與新傳媒立場無關。本集團旗下網站對因上述人士張貼之資訊內容所帶來之損失或損害概不負責。</p> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_18 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type=